  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Chairman and CEO, Kevin Lobo, recently discussed nine key lessons in crisis management with Tom Salemi of Medical Design &amp; Outsourcing, a publication covering the MedTech space. Kevin shares how the focus on protecting our employees, serving our customers and having strong financial discipline helped inform other aspects of his leadership during a very challenging year. <a href=\"https://www.medicaldesignandoutsourcing.com/9-lessons-in-crisis-management-from-stryker-ceo-kevin-lobo/\">Read the full profile</a>.</p>\n<p>Kevin also discussed additional 2020 leadership priorities, including our DE&amp;I journey as a company, and what his experience serving as AdvaMed chairman has taught him, on Salemi’s DeviceTalks podcast. <a href=\"https://www.devicetalks.com/stryker-ceo-kevin-lobo-shares-successful-strategies-for-managing-multiple-crises-aka-life-in-2020/\">Listen to the episode</a>.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jan 11 2021 15:12:46 GMT+0000",
